X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Abba\, whose 52nd Yahrzeit occ
 urs on Saturday\, October 3\, corresponding to the 22nd of Tishrei\, 5787.
 \n\nAbba’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Friday\, October 2 and continue
 s until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to light a memor
 ial candle before sundown as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’
 s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory serve 
 as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
